{title: Udashi Shon}
{artist: Ishan Mitra}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Ki kore boli bol,        Kon bya [G] thai mon pa [A] thor
Ki ko [D] re muchi bol,        Chokhr [G] jol aajke [A] tor
Tara [D] ra kande, bhora bishade,        Phire ta [C] kano ba [G] ron
Keno [D] janina, haat chharina,        Toke ban [C] dhchi oka [Am] ron
Ore [D] O Udashi [A] Shon,        Khunje [Bm] ne pherari [F#m] kon
Toke [G] dukkho ditey [A] chaina,        amar [D] mon
Ore [D] O Udashi [A] Shon,        Khunje [Bm] ne pherari [F#m/Gm] kon
Toke [Em] dukkho ditey [A] chaina,        amar [D] mon
Ki kore boli bol,        Kon bya [G] thai mon pa [A] thor
Ki ko [D] re muchi bol,        Chokher [G] jol aajke [A] tor
Jodi [D] katha di, debo [G] sab kichu,        Jaa [Em] kichu toke [G] deoa [A] jai
Sara [D] raat dhore, maya ban [G] dore,        Toke [Em] rakhbo aaj paha [G] rai [A]
Dishe [D] hara din Swapne rangeen,        Khonje [C] abdarer ma [G] ne
[D] Mayabi prahar, ar ei sahor,        [C] Eka ki abhima [Am] ne
Ore [D] O Udashi [A] Shon,        Khunje [Bm] ne pherari [F#m] kon
Toke [G] dukkho ditey [A] chaina,        amar [D] mon [A]
